(5208042, 757293, 96477, '<td valign="top">no doubt inspired by Ansel''s less well know sephia photography.  nice but the color will hurt you I suspect.</td>', 'no doubt inspired by Ansel''s less well know sephia photography.  nice but the color will hurt you I suspect.', '2009-01-21 00:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
