(5208052, 758142, 76430, '<td valign="top">Ooh, really close to Ansel''s original.  I like it.</td>', 'Ooh, really close to Ansel''s original.  I like it.', '2009-01-21 00:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208061, 758190, 76430, '<td valign="top">Really nice flat landscape, which is hard to make aesthetically pleasing, but isn''t the horizon way off?  Lopsided rather than Balanced?  Not voting.</td>', 'Really nice flat landscape, which is hard to make aesthetically pleasing, but isn''t the horizon way off?  Lopsided rather than Balanced?  Not voting.', '2009-01-21 00:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208069, 757537, 48963, '<td valign="top">lovely photo. it looks a little tilted to the right, gauging by the trees.</td>', 'lovely photo. it looks a little tilted to the right, gauging by the trees.', '2009-01-21 00:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208077, 756849, 48963, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful! if the sky were a little darker, i think it might be a little more Adamsesque.</td>', 'this is beautiful! if the sky were a little darker, i think it might be a little more Adamsesque.', '2009-01-21 00:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208083, 757915, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape, but they look more like cumulus clouds and not thunderheads (cumulonimbus?).  Not voting.<br/> <br/>[eta]As you PM''d me, Thunderhead is the name of the mountain, not a comment on the clouds.  It might have been better to clarify that in the title.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-28 00:45:15.</i></td>', 'Nice landscape, but they look more like cumulus clouds and not thunderheads (cumulonimbus?).  Not voting. [eta]As you PM''d me, Thunderhead is the name of the mountain, not a comment on the clouds.  It might have been better to clarify that in the title.', '2009-01-21 00:37:06.000000', '2009-01-28 00:45:15.000000', 1),
(5208089, 757930, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pond, landscape and cloud formation.</td>', 'Beautiful pond, landscape and cloud formation.', '2009-01-21 00:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208091, 758280, 48963, '<td valign="top">i''m wishing it weren''t such a shallow depth of field. From what I gather one of Adams'' trademarks was his sharp focus from front to back. In another challenge I''d rate this a little higher because it''s not bad.</td>', 'i''m wishing it weren''t such a shallow depth of field. From what I gather one of Adams'' trademarks was his sharp focus from front to back. In another challenge I''d rate this a little higher because it''s not bad.', '2009-01-21 00:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208097, 758182, 48963, '<td valign="top">very cool photo!</td>', 'very cool photo!', '2009-01-21 00:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208098, 757556, 76430, '<td valign="top">LOL, nice play on words.  Not sure it will get high votes though.  It''s not a typical Adams landscape and it''s not very sharp.  No voting from me.</td>', 'LOL, nice play on words.  Not sure it will get high votes though.  It''s not a typical Adams landscape and it''s not very sharp.  No voting from me.', '2009-01-21 00:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208108, 757516, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful border, though it tends to cut a bit into the picture space.  Gorgeous trees.  I like how the bold trunks are near the horizontal rule of thirds lines.  Nice high contrast shot.  I''d like to help you get the coveted ribbon you''re trying for but I''m not voting this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful border, though it tends to cut a bit into the picture space.  Gorgeous trees.  I like how the bold trunks are near the horizontal rule of thirds lines.  Nice high contrast shot.  I''d like to help you get the coveted ribbon you''re trying for but I''m not voting this challenge.', '2009-01-21 00:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208109, 757773, 39429, '<td valign="top">This looks like Cache Valley Utah, and a dsidwell.  Beautiful shot.</td>', 'This looks like Cache Valley Utah, and a dsidwell.  Beautiful shot.', '2009-01-21 00:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208115, 756931, 76430, '<td valign="top">Bold move dissecting the picture across the middle, though both the sky and ground/marsh are equally interesting.</td>', 'Bold move dissecting the picture across the middle, though both the sky and ground/marsh are equally interesting.', '2009-01-21 00:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208118, 757745, 76430, '<td valign="top">I love the detail in the picture.  Graceful tress and grasses.</td>', 'I love the detail in the picture.  Graceful tress and grasses.', '2009-01-21 00:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208125, 757585, 76430, '<td valign="top">No aurora shots in black and white huh?  So, is this what noon looks like this time of year in Iceland?  Nice time exposure and combination of mountain, cityscape and sky.  Good definition across light and dark areas.</td>', 'No aurora shots in black and white huh?  So, is this what noon looks like this time of year in Iceland?  Nice time exposure and combination of mountain, cityscape and sky.  Good definition across light and dark areas.', '2009-01-21 00:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208129, 758139, 62318, '<td valign="top">4</td>', '4', '2009-01-21 00:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208134, 757931, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Yosemite shot.  Perfect reflection.  Is this Mirror Lake?  It must be gorgeous there in the Winter, and not overrun with tourists.</td>', 'Beautiful Yosemite shot.  Perfect reflection.  Is this Mirror Lake?  It must be gorgeous there in the Winter, and not overrun with tourists.', '2009-01-21 00:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208143, 758263, 22537, '<td valign="top">I like this because its interesting. The tonal range is stark and you''ve managed to avoid the haloing around the ridges etc. Good control of the hot light on the horizon as well. One of my top 3 picks. Good luck!</td>', 'I like this because its interesting. The tonal range is stark and you''ve managed to avoid the haloing around the ridges etc. Good control of the hot light on the horizon as well. One of my top 3 picks. Good luck!', '2009-01-21 00:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208149, 757453, 76430, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking Yosemite Valley shot.  What is that El Capitan on the left and Cathedral Rocks on the right?  Well done.</td>', 'Breathtaking Yosemite Valley shot.  What is that El Capitan on the left and Cathedral Rocks on the right?  Well done.', '2009-01-21 00:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208159, 757145, 76430, '<td valign="top">Since you insist.  This looks like a really old photo.  Strong contrast.  The trees are kind of washed out in the background.  Since this is advanced editing you could have tried darkening the background and lightening under the bridge.</td>', 'Since you insist.  This looks like a really old photo.  Strong contrast.  The trees are kind of washed out in the background.  Since this is advanced editing you could have tried darkening the background and lightening under the bridge.', '2009-01-21 01:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208162, 756458, 22537, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful adventure looking at all the textures and varied elements within this image. Hmmmm, trying to pick it apart and am finding elements that can be mentioned but I''d just be a jerk. Nah ...... this is top 3 for sure! 8</td>', 'What a wonderful adventure looking at all the textures and varied elements within this image. Hmmmm, trying to pick it apart and am finding elements that can be mentioned but I''d just be a jerk. Nah ...... this is top 3 for sure! 8', '2009-01-21 01:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208174, 758093, 62318, '<td valign="top">5</td>', '5', '2009-01-21 01:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208179, 757968, 22537, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Sharp, textured and intriguing. Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful image. Sharp, textured and intriguing. Good luck!', '2009-01-21 01:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208183, 757044, 22537, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this shot. The tonal range could have been a bit more stark IMO but otherwise I ranked this as one of my top 20. Good luck!</td>', 'I really like the composition of this shot. The tonal range could have been a bit more stark IMO but otherwise I ranked this as one of my top 20. Good luck!', '2009-01-21 01:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208187, 758142, 22537, '<td valign="top">Hmmm lotsa flowers in this challenge but that said. I think you real "Anseled" the tonal qualities and for that, you get a 7. BTW, bit hot on a few spots on the petals. Good luck!</td>', 'Hmmm lotsa flowers in this challenge but that said. I think you real "Anseled" the tonal qualities and for that, you get a 7. BTW, bit hot on a few spots on the petals. Good luck!', '2009-01-21 01:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208188, 758355, 22537, '<td valign="top">Really simple but I like this alot. Good focal point. Good luck!</td>', 'Really simple but I like this alot. Good focal point. Good luck!', '2009-01-21 01:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208196, 757109, 39427, '<td valign="top">I feel like the composition doesn''t really lead the eye thru the frame</td>', 'I feel like the composition doesn''t really lead the eye thru the frame', '2009-01-21 01:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208197, 757852, 39427, '<td valign="top">too abstract for ansel me thinks</td>', 'too abstract for ansel me thinks', '2009-01-21 01:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208198, 758152, 39427, '<td valign="top">now thats ansel''s contrast!</td>', 'now thats ansel''s contrast!', '2009-01-21 01:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208205, 758226, 39427, '<td valign="top">too simple a shot i think</td>', 'too simple a shot i think', '2009-01-21 01:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208207, 758263, 39427, '<td valign="top">on my screen, just a tad too much contrast, but otherwise and AWESOME shot, great use of wideangle</td>', 'on my screen, just a tad too much contrast, but otherwise and AWESOME shot, great use of wideangle', '2009-01-21 01:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208214, 757676, 39427, '<td valign="top">yep, here we go!  First one i''ve seen that gets at Ansel</td>', 'yep, here we go!  First one i''ve seen that gets at Ansel', '2009-01-21 01:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208217, 756931, 22537, '<td valign="top">Gritty, extreme tonal range, no haloing, good light control ...... hmmmm ..... looks like an Adams to me. 7</td>', 'Gritty, extreme tonal range, no haloing, good light control ...... hmmmm ..... looks like an Adams to me. 7', '2009-01-21 01:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208218, 757453, 674, '<td valign="top">This would have been a winner if it hadn''t been spoilt by excessive sharpenining it looks more like a wood etching now.<br/> <br/>10 for composition nd exposure 3 for processing,  6 overall</td>', 'This would have been a winner if it hadn''t been spoilt by excessive sharpenining it looks more like a wood etching now. 10 for composition nd exposure 3 for processing,  6 overall', '2009-01-21 01:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208219, 758001, 39427, '<td valign="top">love the attention to detail in the composition, thats my favorite thing to see.  Contrast and tones also lovely, great take on Ansel 9</td>', 'love the attention to detail in the composition, thats my favorite thing to see.  Contrast and tones also lovely, great take on Ansel 9', '2009-01-21 01:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208220, 756344, 22537, '<td valign="top">Simple. Great tonal range, stark, not over sharpened, good perspective ... I like! 7</td>', 'Simple. Great tonal range, stark, not over sharpened, good perspective ... I like! 7', '2009-01-21 01:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208221, 757443, 39427, '<td valign="top">cool shot for sure but i don''t think ansel was into the sort of theatrical shots</td>', 'cool shot for sure but i don''t think ansel was into the sort of theatrical shots', '2009-01-21 01:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208222, 758347, 22537, '<td valign="top">Well done and the composition works for me. Little bit of haloing on the left ridge but its minor. Great work. 7</td>', 'Well done and the composition works for me. Little bit of haloing on the left ridge but its minor. Great work. 7', '2009-01-21 01:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208227, 757422, 39427, '<td valign="top">composition is rather flat and un-dynamic, no real feeling of depth, at least in B/w with such contrast...</td>', 'composition is rather flat and un-dynamic, no real feeling of depth, at least in B/w with such contrast...', '2009-01-21 01:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208228, 757676, 22537, '<td valign="top">Fantastisch kühl. 7</td>', 'Fantastisch kühl. 7', '2009-01-21 01:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208229, 757598, 39427, '<td valign="top">man, which you were just a foot or 2 to the left for that separation between the gum tree and the treeline... also would be improved by a more dynamic sky but probably not much you could do about that!</td>', 'man, which you were just a foot or 2 to the left for that separation between the gum tree and the treeline... also would be improved by a more dynamic sky but probably not much you could do about that!', '2009-01-21 01:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208261, 758138, 63503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture. Blurry clouds is not a feature you see in most Adams photos, he did not use much shallow DOF, maybe because the available equipment in those days did not allow for it.</td>', 'Beautiful picture. Blurry clouds is not a feature you see in most Adams photos, he did not use much shallow DOF, maybe because the available equipment in those days did not allow for it.', '2009-01-21 01:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208262, 758216, 51638, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the reflection on the water makes this a little confusing to look at. I''m struggling to find an obvious focal point.</td>', 'Sorry, but the reflection on the water makes this a little confusing to look at. I''m struggling to find an obvious focal point.', '2009-01-21 02:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208264, 756849, 51638, '<td valign="top">Nice. Now why don''t I have access to scenes this to shoot?</td>', 'Nice. Now why don''t I have access to scenes this to shoot?', '2009-01-21 02:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208265, 758037, 51638, '<td valign="top">A little too dark IMO, made more so by the choice of a black border.</td>', 'A little too dark IMO, made more so by the choice of a black border.', '2009-01-21 02:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208269, 757931, 51638, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, although perhaps doesn''t have quite the tonal range that AA was recognized for.</td>', 'Very nice shot, although perhaps doesn''t have quite the tonal range that AA was recognized for.', '2009-01-21 02:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208270, 758278, 51638, '<td valign="top">Fairly flat looking IMO. Lacking a bit in tonal range.</td>', 'Fairly flat looking IMO. Lacking a bit in tonal range.', '2009-01-21 02:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208271, 758082, 51638, '<td valign="top">IMO the contrast here has been pushed too far and the highlights are lacking detail.</td>', 'IMO the contrast here has been pushed too far and the highlights are lacking detail.', '2009-01-21 02:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208272, 758042, 102534, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of tones and textures. Like how the bridges also frame the rocks.</td>', 'Nice contrast of tones and textures. Like how the bridges also frame the rocks.', '2009-01-21 02:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208273, 757677, 51638, '<td valign="top">Taken from a plane? Looks like it as the focus seems a little off.</td>', 'Taken from a plane? Looks like it as the focus seems a little off.', '2009-01-21 02:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208275, 757891, 51638, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Perhaps not your best know style of AA image, but it works for me.</td>', 'Nice shot. Perhaps not your best know style of AA image, but it works for me.', '2009-01-21 02:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208276, 757145, 51638, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve pushed the contrast too far and ended up with an image a little lacking in detail, which I don''t believe is typical of AA''s style.</td>', 'I think you''ve pushed the contrast too far and ended up with an image a little lacking in detail, which I don''t believe is typical of AA''s style.', '2009-01-21 02:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208277, 757149, 51638, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene, but the highlights are too blown IMO. A large proportion of the image lacks detail as a result.</td>', 'Lovely scene, but the highlights are too blown IMO. A large proportion of the image lacks detail as a result.', '2009-01-21 02:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208279, 758220, 51638, '<td valign="top">The blown highlight in the middle of the image really detracts.</td>', 'The blown highlight in the middle of the image really detracts.', '2009-01-21 02:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208280, 757485, 51638, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the leading lines.</td>', 'Nice. I like the leading lines.', '2009-01-21 02:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208282, 758143, 51638, '<td valign="top">Very Adams-esque IMO.</td>', 'Very Adams-esque IMO.', '2009-01-21 02:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208283, 756458, 51638, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Very true to Adam''s style. Well done.</td>', 'Very cool. Very true to Adam''s style. Well done.', '2009-01-21 02:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208285, 757408, 51638, '<td valign="top">Sorry but there is way too much overblown highlight for this to work IMO.</td>', 'Sorry but there is way too much overblown highlight for this to work IMO.', '2009-01-21 02:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208286, 757516, 51638, '<td valign="top">Presumably you are attempting to win the brown? For that reason I''m not going to give you a 1 as I suspect many will.</td>', 'Presumably you are attempting to win the brown? For that reason I''m not going to give you a 1 as I suspect many will.', '2009-01-21 02:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208291, 757676, 51638, '<td valign="top">No fair you guys who get to shoot the sort of scenery Adams was famous for. Nice shot.</td>', 'No fair you guys who get to shoot the sort of scenery Adams was famous for. Nice shot.', '2009-01-21 02:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208293, 757931, 96751, '<td valign="top">Same subject, gorgeous reflection! Perhaps it''s my monitor, but the trees could be a little sharper.  Even so, this should do VERY well.</td>', 'Same subject, gorgeous reflection! Perhaps it''s my monitor, but the trees could be a little sharper.  Even so, this should do VERY well.', '2009-01-21 02:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208294, 756850, 96751, '<td valign="top">Amazing phenomenon!  I like the detail of the ice on either side of the main fall better than the fall itself.</td>', 'Amazing phenomenon!  I like the detail of the ice on either side of the main fall better than the fall itself.', '2009-01-21 02:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208296, 757149, 96751, '<td valign="top">The upper half has much better detail, clarity, and contrast than the bottom half.</td>', 'The upper half has much better detail, clarity, and contrast than the bottom half.', '2009-01-21 02:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208298, 757676, 96751, '<td valign="top">You are SO lucky to have gone there!!!  Is this Sedona?  Gorgeous shot.  Looks a bit oversharpened on the left cliff face.</td>', 'You are SO lucky to have gone there!!!  Is this Sedona?  Gorgeous shot.  Looks a bit oversharpened on the left cliff face.', '2009-01-21 02:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208299, 757199, 96751, '<td valign="top">Incredible timing!  I love this shot.  I wish there was just a bit more lighting separation between the body and the water.</td>', 'Incredible timing!  I love this shot.  I wish there was just a bit more lighting separation between the body and the water.', '2009-01-21 02:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208300, 758309, 96751, '<td valign="top">Incredible sharpness, clarity, and detail, but I''m not wild about the composition, which looks a bit cluttered.</td>', 'Incredible sharpness, clarity, and detail, but I''m not wild about the composition, which looks a bit cluttered.', '2009-01-21 02:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208301, 758070, 88718, '<td valign="top">This subject could have had some very interesting compositions. However you chose to include as many aspects as possible and in so doing the photo has no focus</td>', 'This subject could have had some very interesting compositions. However you chose to include as many aspects as possible and in so doing the photo has no focus', '2009-01-21 02:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208304, 757841, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice mood.  The shot feels a bit wider than it has to be, and the fisherman is in a dark patch, making him not as visible as he could be.  Still a great shot.  The sharpness on the sunlit water makes a great contrast with the misty surroundings.</td>', 'Nice mood.  The shot feels a bit wider than it has to be, and the fisherman is in a dark patch, making him not as visible as he could be.  Still a great shot.  The sharpness on the sunlit water makes a great contrast with the misty surroundings.', '2009-01-21 02:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
