(5208526, 758095, 54446, '<td valign="top">Excellent image.  I scored it well.  However, the manmade stuff here is one of the things AA used his environmental photograph to campaign against.  I didn''t mark down your score because of it, but it''s one of the things which would be highly offensive to AA during the time of his landscape work.</td>', 'Excellent image.  I scored it well.  However, the manmade stuff here is one of the things AA used his environmental photograph to campaign against.  I didn''t mark down your score because of it, but it''s one of the things which would be highly offensive to AA during the time of his landscape work.', '2009-01-21 06:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
