(5208551, 758286, 54446, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous landscape.  Great sky.  Well processed.  I scored it well.  As an aside, AA would not have included the barbed wire fence in his scene.  Fencing off the ranges was and still is controversial.  Anathema to the protectors of the wilderness at the time.  I didn''t mark down your score for the inclusion of the fence.</td>', 'Gorgeous landscape.  Great sky.  Well processed.  I scored it well.  As an aside, AA would not have included the barbed wire fence in his scene.  Fencing off the ranges was and still is controversial.  Anathema to the protectors of the wilderness at the time.  I didn''t mark down your score for the inclusion of the fence.', '2009-01-21 06:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208553, 758332, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good tones.  Unlevel horizon.  Needs a CCW rotation.</td>', 'Good tones.  Unlevel horizon.  Needs a CCW rotation.', '2009-01-21 06:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
