(5208654, 756468, 30861, '<td valign="top">You appear to have layered a copy of the image on itself for the purpose of bumping contrast with a soft light mode or somesuch, but unfortunately they are out of register; see the "double edges"? If it was accidental, too bad :-( If it was intentional, it''s not workign for me...</td>', 'You appear to have layered a copy of the image on itself for the purpose of bumping contrast with a soft light mode or somesuch, but unfortunately they are out of register; see the "double edges"? If it was accidental, too bad :-( If it was intentional, it''s not workign for me...', '2009-01-21 07:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208656, 757609, 76598, '<td valign="top">Odd spots, cows? sheep?  the composition is relatively pleasing, but those errant ant-like spots are annoying :)</td>', 'Odd spots, cows? sheep?  the composition is relatively pleasing, but those errant ant-like spots are annoying :)', '2009-01-21 07:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208657, 757773, 76598, '<td valign="top">The foreground adds to the image, but it might have been better with a little less of it.  Nice image</td>', 'The foreground adds to the image, but it might have been better with a little less of it.  Nice image', '2009-01-21 07:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208658, 758190, 76598, '<td valign="top">Good contrast and composition, the best I have scored so far</td>', 'Good contrast and composition, the best I have scored so far', '2009-01-21 07:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208659, 757516, 76598, '<td valign="top">Were you going for brown?</td>', 'Were you going for brown?', '2009-01-21 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208663, 758351, 76598, '<td valign="top">Being in an urban environment with this challenge would be tough, you have made a really nice image that meets the essence of Adams....nice job</td>', 'Being in an urban environment with this challenge would be tough, you have made a really nice image that meets the essence of Adams....nice job', '2009-01-21 07:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208664, 757470, 30861, '<td valign="top">note to self: add comment later</td>', 'note to self: add comment later', '2009-01-21 07:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208666, 757346, 76598, '<td valign="top">I like this, It might be better with a tighter crop on the bottom</td>', 'I like this, It might be better with a tighter crop on the bottom', '2009-01-21 07:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208668, 758345, 30861, '<td valign="top">note to self: add comment later</td>', 'note to self: add comment later', '2009-01-21 07:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208669, 757485, 76598, '<td valign="top">There is a lot to like about the image, the road draws you in and the snow muting the trees is very nice, I think I would like to see all of the first curve of the road to make the image more complete or cropped out the front road...the road segment across the front is distracting</td>', 'There is a lot to like about the image, the road draws you in and the snow muting the trees is very nice, I think I would like to see all of the first curve of the road to make the image more complete or cropped out the front road...the road segment across the front is distracting', '2009-01-21 07:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208671, 758345, 76598, '<td valign="top">The front of the church appears to be over exposed</td>', 'The front of the church appears to be over exposed', '2009-01-21 07:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208675, 758182, 95579, '<td valign="top">Good luck Bobert!!  I would give you an 8 but cant cos I know its you - hope others vote as I would have done : )</td>', 'Good luck Bobert!!  I would give you an 8 but cant cos I know its you - hope others vote as I would have done : )', '2009-01-21 07:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208676, 758302, 76598, '<td valign="top">I really like this, a lot of contrasting forms...visually though, I would like to see more...like the top of the waterfall, more of the tree...you may have the best image available from it..but it leaves me yearning to see more</td>', 'I really like this, a lot of contrasting forms...visually though, I would like to see more...like the top of the waterfall, more of the tree...you may have the best image available from it..but it leaves me yearning to see more', '2009-01-21 07:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208678, 757505, 76598, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrasting forms and texture in this, but it strikes me that it is either not in focus or lacks sharpening</td>', 'I really like the contrasting forms and texture in this, but it strikes me that it is either not in focus or lacks sharpening', '2009-01-21 08:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208681, 758142, 95579, '<td valign="top">Superb recreation of a superb photo. Im guessing its a silk rose rather than real as the petals dont show much texture. Doesnt detract from the shot as it really is lovely</td>', 'Superb recreation of a superb photo. Im guessing its a silk rose rather than real as the petals dont show much texture. Doesnt detract from the shot as it really is lovely', '2009-01-21 08:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208684, 757970, 76598, '<td valign="top">The leading line is good, but it seems to break the image into two parts rather than bring you into it.  Maybe using a bit different angle to have the line not split the image would have improved it.</td>', 'The leading line is good, but it seems to break the image into two parts rather than bring you into it.  Maybe using a bit different angle to have the line not split the image would have improved it.', '2009-01-21 08:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208701, 758038, 98647, '<td valign="top">The bottom is a bit dark to me. I would have liked to see a bit more detail in the pier.</td>', 'The bottom is a bit dark to me. I would have liked to see a bit more detail in the pier.', '2009-01-21 08:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208735, 757759, 75192, '<td valign="top">Really like this one. The cows make a great focal point. 10.</td>', 'Really like this one. The cows make a great focal point. 10.', '2009-01-21 08:23:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5208741, 757516, 100064, '<td valign="top">hahahah</td>', 'hahahah', '2009-01-21 08:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208746, 757145, 98647, '<td valign="top">I like the bridge, but the trees in the background are too white.</td>', 'I like the bridge, but the trees in the background are too white.', '2009-01-21 08:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208764, 757699, 75192, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this will score well, but I think it''s beautiful. Ansel was not a landscape photographer exclusively - he did macro too. 10.</td>', 'I don''t think this will score well, but I think it''s beautiful. Ansel was not a landscape photographer exclusively - he did macro too. 10.', '2009-01-21 08:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208790, 757192, 98647, '<td valign="top">I relate to what you were going for in this shot until my eye hits the ''dash''. I would have cropped it.</td>', 'I relate to what you were going for in this shot until my eye hits the ''dash''. I would have cropped it.', '2009-01-21 08:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208797, 757915, 102897, '<td valign="top">I like the tonal qualities of this shot, but the title is a misnomer.  Those are not thunderhead clouds.</td>', 'I like the tonal qualities of this shot, but the title is a misnomer.  Those are not thunderhead clouds.', '2009-01-21 08:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208798, 758301, 41129, '<td valign="top">i like the sun glare</td>', 'i like the sun glare', '2009-01-21 08:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208799, 757485, 102897, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of the photo.  I would have liked to have seen the curve on the left that got cut off.</td>', 'I like the softness of the photo.  I would have liked to have seen the curve on the left that got cut off.', '2009-01-21 08:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208800, 757970, 98647, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W conversion on this. What I think could be stronger is the composition of the foreground, so that it isn''t split in half.</td>', 'I like the B&W conversion on this. What I think could be stronger is the composition of the foreground, so that it isn''t split in half.', '2009-01-21 08:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208802, 758235, 41129, '<td valign="top">nice bridge would be good location for a photoshoot</td>', 'nice bridge would be good location for a photoshoot', '2009-01-21 08:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208803, 757574, 102897, '<td valign="top">I really like the moodiness of this shot.  The softness implies quiet and the exposure really sets the mood.  It doesn''t strike me as Ansel Adams, however, but I like the shot.</td>', 'I really like the moodiness of this shot.  The softness implies quiet and the exposure really sets the mood.  It doesn''t strike me as Ansel Adams, however, but I like the shot.', '2009-01-21 08:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208809, 757211, 98647, '<td valign="top">Says Ansel Adams to me.</td>', 'Says Ansel Adams to me.', '2009-01-21 08:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208812, 757745, 41129, '<td valign="top">love the sky,,</td>', 'love the sky,,', '2009-01-21 08:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208822, 758219, 98171, '<td valign="top">Definitely wish you had not centered the tree.  Otherwise, the tones/mood is great.</td>', 'Definitely wish you had not centered the tree.  Otherwise, the tones/mood is great.', '2009-01-21 08:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208829, 758263, 98647, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic. Unfortunately, there''s a line separating the right and left sides of the sky (from burning?).</td>', 'Very dramatic. Unfortunately, there''s a line separating the right and left sides of the sky (from burning?).', '2009-01-21 09:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208840, 756096, 60910, '<td valign="top">Winner!  Wow, it''s exquisite!!!</td>', 'Winner!  Wow, it''s exquisite!!!', '2009-01-21 09:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208841, 757609, 98647, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The foreground looks ''blotchy'' though.</td>', 'Nice composition. The foreground looks ''blotchy'' though.', '2009-01-21 09:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208847, 758196, 60910, '<td valign="top">wow, very similar to his off the beaten track random still life!</td>', 'wow, very similar to his off the beaten track random still life!', '2009-01-21 09:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208866, 757050, 98647, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. Some post processing could make it a lot better. The horizon line is not straight, and a bit more contrast might help.</td>', 'I like the composition. Some post processing could make it a lot better. The horizon line is not straight, and a bit more contrast might help.', '2009-01-21 09:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208870, 757516, 97893, '<td valign="top">?...Interesting...I shall be curios to see what you are driving at. 7 for creativity.</td>', '?...Interesting...I shall be curios to see what you are driving at. 7 for creativity.', '2009-01-21 09:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208872, 757183, 97893, '<td valign="top">Borders distract a bit(particularly the outside rim).<br/> <br/>Otherwise a fantastic picture. 8.</td>', 'Borders distract a bit(particularly the outside rim). Otherwise a fantastic picture. 8.', '2009-01-21 09:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208873, 757516, 20577, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! Love the detail! Wish the border was just a little bigger though.</td>', 'Brilliant! Love the detail! Wish the border was just a little bigger though.', '2009-01-21 09:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208884, 757044, 98647, '<td valign="top">When I scroll down so that I can''t see some of the sky, it''s better to me, because I like the repetition of the lines on the structure.</td>', 'When I scroll down so that I can''t see some of the sky, it''s better to me, because I like the repetition of the lines on the structure.', '2009-01-21 09:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208887, 756878, 97893, '<td valign="top">Something very nice about this picture! Despite a clutter you have created a harmony. 9.</td>', 'Something very nice about this picture! Despite a clutter you have created a harmony. 9.', '2009-01-21 09:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208888, 757263, 98647, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.</td>', 'Great lighting.', '2009-01-21 09:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208895, 757816, 84363, '<td valign="top">Looks out of focus and pixelated</td>', 'Looks out of focus and pixelated', '2009-01-21 09:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208903, 758297, 84363, '<td valign="top">Ansel primarily shot landscapes and did very few objects.  Those objects he did shoot had a wide depth of field and were very sharp!</td>', 'Ansel primarily shot landscapes and did very few objects.  Those objects he did shoot had a wide depth of field and were very sharp!', '2009-01-21 09:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208904, 758326, 98647, '<td valign="top">This is literally black and white. I would have liked to see some more greys in the shot.</td>', 'This is literally black and white. I would have liked to see some more greys in the shot.', '2009-01-21 09:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208909, 757192, 84363, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but it needs to be black and white not sepia!</td>', 'Nice photo, but it needs to be black and white not sepia!', '2009-01-21 09:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208910, 758229, 98647, '<td valign="top">It''s nice to see something other than landscapes. The composition is a bit busy to me. The shallow depth of focus helps, but my eye keeps being drawn to the background, maybe because it''s lighter.</td>', 'It''s nice to see something other than landscapes. The composition is a bit busy to me. The shallow depth of focus helps, but my eye keeps being drawn to the background, maybe because it''s lighter.', '2009-01-21 09:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208913, 758082, 84363, '<td valign="top">Totally uncharacteristic of an AA photo.</td>', 'Totally uncharacteristic of an AA photo.', '2009-01-21 09:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208916, 757912, 84363, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but the lack of ''drama'' kinda hurts the image.</td>', 'Nice image, but the lack of ''drama'' kinda hurts the image.', '2009-01-21 09:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208919, 757516, 99981, '<td valign="top">Is that you <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">yospiff</a>?</td>', 'Is that you  yospiff?', '2009-01-21 09:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208926, 758267, 84363, '<td valign="top">Fairly nice tonal range, but your eye gets lost.  It is hard to tell where the rock ends and the water begins.  AA tried to be very clear with his images and didn''t try to fool your eye.</td>', 'Fairly nice tonal range, but your eye gets lost.  It is hard to tell where the rock ends and the water begins.  AA tried to be very clear with his images and didn''t try to fool your eye.', '2009-01-21 09:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208930, 758216, 84363, '<td valign="top">The whites are blown out.  The reflection in the pond is bothering and distracting.  It may help to have some true blacks and work on the post processing.</td>', 'The whites are blown out.  The reflection in the pond is bothering and distracting.  It may help to have some true blacks and work on the post processing.', '2009-01-21 09:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208932, 758301, 84363, '<td valign="top">AA did very little to shoot man made structures.</td>', 'AA did very little to shoot man made structures.', '2009-01-21 09:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208936, 757328, 84363, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  You, like myself, were probably hoping for some clouds this day???</td>', 'Very nice image.  You, like myself, were probably hoping for some clouds this day???', '2009-01-21 09:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208938, 757485, 84363, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Would like to see some true blacks in this.</td>', 'Nice image.  Would like to see some true blacks in this.', '2009-01-21 09:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208942, 758296, 84363, '<td valign="top">I am pretty sure I have never seen an A. Adams shot done in pink...  Also, the white highlights seem to be overdone.</td>', 'I am pretty sure I have never seen an A. Adams shot done in pink...  Also, the white highlights seem to be overdone.', '2009-01-21 09:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208945, 758062, 84363, '<td valign="top">Love the solo cactus.  However, the focus seems to be off and the image looks to be pixelated.</td>', 'Love the solo cactus.  However, the focus seems to be off and the image looks to be pixelated.', '2009-01-21 09:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208947, 758235, 84363, '<td valign="top">Not sure this really fits the Ansel Adams style.  I don''t know that he ever photographed a man made bridge.</td>', 'Not sure this really fits the Ansel Adams style.  I don''t know that he ever photographed a man made bridge.', '2009-01-21 09:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208950, 757378, 97893, '<td valign="top">I like such pictures, that try to connect the elements in the frame. And this is wonderful for me!</td>', 'I like such pictures, that try to connect the elements in the frame. And this is wonderful for me!', '2009-01-21 09:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208951, 757476, 84363, '<td valign="top">Not sure this really fits the Ansel Adams style</td>', 'Not sure this really fits the Ansel Adams style', '2009-01-21 09:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208952, 757745, 84363, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Although it looks a little to surreal and over processed for the AA style</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Although it looks a little to surreal and over processed for the AA style', '2009-01-21 09:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208954, 757851, 84363, '<td valign="top">How I would love to see some clouds in this one!</td>', 'How I would love to see some clouds in this one!', '2009-01-21 09:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208957, 758093, 102481, '<td valign="top">Wow...</td>', 'Wow...', '2009-01-21 09:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208960, 757334, 84363, '<td valign="top">Very nice attempt at Rose On Driftwood.  I would like to see a little more texture in the wood you used.  Also, more tonal range is needed in the rose, but other wise very good job!</td>', 'Very nice attempt at Rose On Driftwood.  I would like to see a little more texture in the wood you used.  Also, more tonal range is needed in the rose, but other wise very good job!', '2009-01-21 09:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208964, 757516, 84363, '<td valign="top">Not sure I would have done this on this particular challenge.  I bet the voting trolls are having a hay day...</td>', 'Not sure I would have done this on this particular challenge.  I bet the voting trolls are having a hay day...', '2009-01-21 09:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208965, 758289, 84363, '<td valign="top">Everything is very muted and gray.  Would like to see some true whites.</td>', 'Everything is very muted and gray.  Would like to see some true whites.', '2009-01-21 09:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208969, 757410, 84363, '<td valign="top">For the Ansel Adams style I think true vertical would have served you better.</td>', 'For the Ansel Adams style I think true vertical would have served you better.', '2009-01-21 09:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208970, 758226, 84363, '<td valign="top">Needs to be B/W and not sepia</td>', 'Needs to be B/W and not sepia', '2009-01-21 09:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208973, 757771, 84363, '<td valign="top">Image is pixelated and looks out of focus to me</td>', 'Image is pixelated and looks out of focus to me', '2009-01-21 09:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208975, 757143, 84363, '<td valign="top">The uneven thick black border really hurts this image.  The border at least needs to be of equal weight all the way around.</td>', 'The uneven thick black border really hurts this image.  The border at least needs to be of equal weight all the way around.', '2009-01-21 09:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208979, 757599, 84363, '<td valign="top">Not sure I have ever seen an AA photo of the cityscape before?</td>', 'Not sure I have ever seen an AA photo of the cityscape before?', '2009-01-21 09:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208983, 758039, 84363, '<td valign="top">LOL...I think when Adams went on vacation he left his camera at home???</td>', 'LOL...I think when Adams went on vacation he left his camera at home???', '2009-01-21 09:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208984, 756527, 84363, '<td valign="top">Not sure the border really fits the AA style</td>', 'Not sure the border really fits the AA style', '2009-01-21 09:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208991, 758002, 84363, '<td valign="top">Didn''t know AA spent much time in the cow pasture?</td>', 'Didn''t know AA spent much time in the cow pasture?', '2009-01-21 09:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208994, 758218, 84363, '<td valign="top">Nice image but doesn''t really fit the AA style</td>', 'Nice image but doesn''t really fit the AA style', '2009-01-21 09:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208997, 758180, 84363, '<td valign="top">Needs to be B/W and not sepia</td>', 'Needs to be B/W and not sepia', '2009-01-21 09:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209001, 757556, 84363, '<td valign="top">Focus and detail???</td>', 'Focus and detail???', '2009-01-21 09:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209003, 758135, 44877, '<td valign="top">Very striking image - well done. I feel I could have lived without the border. Though it''s not awful, it seems to limit the expanse of the photo. I like the high contrast, and great job on the sky and moon.</td>', 'Very striking image - well done. I feel I could have lived without the border. Though it''s not awful, it seems to limit the expanse of the photo. I like the high contrast, and great job on the sky and moon.', '2009-01-21 09:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209007, 757737, 44877, '<td valign="top">Very nice, crisp lines.</td>', 'Very nice, crisp lines.', '2009-01-21 09:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209010, 758069, 44877, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous - love those lights and the reflections.</td>', 'Gorgeous - love those lights and the reflections.', '2009-01-21 09:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209012, 758223, 44877, '<td valign="top">Sweet! Love the shadows and the high contrast.</td>', 'Sweet! Love the shadows and the high contrast.', '2009-01-21 09:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209015, 757771, 44877, '<td valign="top">A little less foreground and a little more background would have been more balanced. Lots of noise - I''m not a noise fan, personally. Contrast is good and those mountains are the bomb.</td>', 'A little less foreground and a little more background would have been more balanced. Lots of noise - I''m not a noise fan, personally. Contrast is good and those mountains are the bomb.', '2009-01-21 09:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209017, 758160, 44877, '<td valign="top">Good contrast.</td>', 'Good contrast.', '2009-01-21 10:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209022, 757609, 44877, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Wonder what the specks are... they must be really far away to be specks, unless they''re really small... Anyway, contrast could be a tad crisper. 6</td>', 'Great composition. Wonder what the specks are... they must be really far away to be specks, unless they''re really small... Anyway, contrast could be a tad crisper. 6', '2009-01-21 10:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209023, 757443, 79057, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the black and white.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the black and white.', '2009-01-21 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209026, 756797, 30861, '<td valign="top">note to self: add comment later</td>', 'note to self: add comment later', '2009-01-21 10:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209029, 757455, 44877, '<td valign="top">Clarity and contrast are outstanding.</td>', 'Clarity and contrast are outstanding.', '2009-01-21 10:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209033, 757676, 44877, '<td valign="top">I''m smelling a ribbon. Excellent image - detail is amazing.</td>', 'I''m smelling a ribbon. Excellent image - detail is amazing.', '2009-01-21 10:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209036, 758050, 44877, '<td valign="top">Impressive. Good job at not blowing out the snow.</td>', 'Impressive. Good job at not blowing out the snow.', '2009-01-21 10:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209038, 758002, 44877, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this!</td>', 'Absolutely love this!', '2009-01-21 10:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209039, 756821, 30861, '<td valign="top">Love the architecture :-) Hate the tilted horizon; a good option would have been to use photoshop''s perspective control to level horizon without keystoning the architecture. Overall the tones are overworked and a little lifeless, and I can see artifacts from burning in the image along the rightmost roof slope, there''s a slight darkening of the sky there. So, conceptually this is good but in execution it is lackluster.<br/> <br/>If you have any interest in working with me to see what can be done from the original (because I suspect it''s a MUCH better image than it''s coming across) I''d be happy to do that. If not, you can just ignore me :-)</td>', 'Love the architecture :-) Hate the tilted horizon; a good option would have been to use photoshop''s perspective control to level horizon without keystoning the architecture. Overall the tones are overworked and a little lifeless, and I can see artifacts from burning in the image along the rightmost roof slope, there''s a slight darkening of the sky there. So, conceptually this is good but in execution it is lackluster. If you have any interest in working with me to see what can be done from the original (because I suspect it''s a MUCH better image than it''s coming across) I''d be happy to do that. If not, you can just ignore me :-)', '2009-01-21 10:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209040, 758152, 44877, '<td valign="top">Super duper high contrast - my goodness! Totally excellent.</td>', 'Super duper high contrast - my goodness! Totally excellent.', '2009-01-21 10:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
