(5209102, 758271, 51538, '<td valign="top">You caught some lovely tones in the sky.  It''s a subtle image.</td>', 'You caught some lovely tones in the sky.  It''s a subtle image.', '2009-01-21 10:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209105, 757890, 30861, '<td valign="top">Another nod to the Adams "detail" genre, and very nicely done. I''m a little offput by the peripheral lightening of the BG around the petals, it''s quite artificial looking and *seems* more sloppy than intentional. In Ansel''s work we never see this clumsiness of effect, the transitions are almost always seamless, subtle and organic in nature, even if the effect itself (when comparing to the "straight" contact print) might be extreme.</td>', 'Another nod to the Adams "detail" genre, and very nicely done. I''m a little offput by the peripheral lightening of the BG around the petals, it''s quite artificial looking and *seems* more sloppy than intentional. In Ansel''s work we never see this clumsiness of effect, the transitions are almost always seamless, subtle and organic in nature, even if the effect itself (when comparing to the "straight" contact print) might be extreme.', '2009-01-21 10:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209107, 757501, 30861, '<td valign="top">note to self: add comment later</td>', 'note to self: add comment later', '2009-01-21 10:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209110, 757537, 92577, '<td valign="top">fab - one of the best so far - (of course the location lends a hand)   :)</td>', 'fab - one of the best so far - (of course the location lends a hand)   :)', '2009-01-21 10:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209115, 758262, 30861, '<td valign="top">The rendering of tones here is excellent, as is the overall sense of sharpness and detail. The lighting is a bit on the anemic side, and the composition fairly lackluster, so overall the image doesn''t have the "Oh, wow!" factor that the best few of these entries have. Still, you''ve captured very well the *technical* qualities of a decent "Ansel"; this is one of the better-rendered of the snow scenes, given what you had to work with.</td>', 'The rendering of tones here is excellent, as is the overall sense of sharpness and detail. The lighting is a bit on the anemic side, and the composition fairly lackluster, so overall the image doesn''t have the "Oh, wow!" factor that the best few of these entries have. Still, you''ve captured very well the *technical* qualities of a decent "Ansel"; this is one of the better-rendered of the snow scenes, given what you had to work with.', '2009-01-21 10:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209117, 757609, 92577, '<td valign="top">who could have known the next challenge would be ''a single tree''? - 7</td>', 'who could have known the next challenge would be ''a single tree''? - 7', '2009-01-21 10:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
