(5209349, 757443, 92577, '<td valign="top">After all the snowy picture i''ve seen I thought this too, was frozen tundra, which made me think wow! Then I realized it was sand and probably quite warm.<br/>The model''s posture is a little awkward as if she''s snagged her dress. Maybe she should be staring wistfully into the distance?<br/>Overall it has a great sense of space and atmosphere and would be best appreciated blown up to a big scale.<br/>(Sorry for rambling on - I''m a bit bored this afternoon) 8</td>', 'After all the snowy picture i''ve seen I thought this too, was frozen tundra, which made me think wow! Then I realized it was sand and probably quite warm.The model''s posture is a little awkward as if she''s snagged her dress. Maybe she should be staring wistfully into the distance?Overall it has a great sense of space and atmosphere and would be best appreciated blown up to a big scale.(Sorry for rambling on - I''m a bit bored this afternoon) 8', '2009-01-21 11:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209361, 757574, 99384, '<td valign="top">This photo has a real sense of mystery. It makes you wonder where the person is going on this cool misty day. I love how it''s framed by the trees and how the path leads your eye all the way in to the person walking. Great job!</td>', 'This photo has a real sense of mystery. It makes you wonder where the person is going on this cool misty day. I love how it''s framed by the trees and how the path leads your eye all the way in to the person walking. Great job!', '2009-01-21 12:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
