(5211027, 757599, 22537, '<td valign="top">I think this is a superb image but .... the tones could have been a bit more dramatic to nail the Ansel Adams look for me. Otherwise, a great shot. Bumping up to a 7.</td>', 'I think this is a superb image but .... the tones could have been a bit more dramatic to nail the Ansel Adams look for me. Otherwise, a great shot. Bumping up to a 7.', '2009-01-22 00:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
