(5211199, 757556, 24486, '<td valign="top">To be perfectly honest, I''m just not sure what i am looking at.</td>', 'To be perfectly honest, I''m just not sure what i am looking at.', '2009-01-22 03:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211205, 756468, 24486, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. Your droplets of water haven''t helped you. They almost look like hot pixels but that is probably more down to the way your light source has been reflected. The image itself is too out of focus  for me &amp; I probably would not of cropped the top of the rose off.</td>', 'I like the concept. Your droplets of water haven''t helped you. They almost look like hot pixels but that is probably more down to the way your light source has been reflected. The image itself is too out of focus  for me & I probably would not of cropped the top of the rose off.', '2009-01-22 03:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211206, 756669, 24486, '<td valign="top">What a grand photograph. That actually brings back a lot of happy memories for me seeing this photograph. Thanks.</td>', 'What a grand photograph. That actually brings back a lot of happy memories for me seeing this photograph. Thanks.', '2009-01-22 03:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
