(5211337, 757851, 18655, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning! This couls easily have been an AA print. The light hits the mountain perfectly to give it good depth. Excellent DOF on everything as well which is also one of AA''s trademarks. 10+</td>', 'Absolutely stunning! This couls easily have been an AA print. The light hits the mountain perfectly to give it good depth. Excellent DOF on everything as well which is also one of AA''s trademarks. 10+', '2009-01-22 08:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
