(5211344, 757452, 18655, '<td valign="top">I can''t recall AA having a lot of shots beig way off level. I would defintely have straigtened this before submitting it.</td>', 'I can''t recall AA having a lot of shots beig way off level. I would defintely have straigtened this before submitting it.', '2009-01-22 08:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211345, 757537, 18655, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image and very Ansel like. I wish it had been rotated a couple of degrees CCW thought. I feel I need to tilt my head when looking at it. Otherwise very good. Clouds and light cooperated and it looks very 3D with everything in focus - which obviously was one of AA''s trademarks. 9 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful image and very Ansel like. I wish it had been rotated a couple of degrees CCW thought. I feel I need to tilt my head when looking at it. Otherwise very good. Clouds and light cooperated and it looks very 3D with everything in focus - which obviously was one of AA''s trademarks. 9 from me.', '2009-01-22 08:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211347, 758332, 18655, '<td valign="top">Argh! Why are there so many images in this challenge that are not straight and level?? You may have done this on purpose, but I feel I need to tilt my head looking at it. Otherwise good and a full range of greytones. 6</td>', 'Argh! Why are there so many images in this challenge that are not straight and level?? You may have done this on purpose, but I feel I need to tilt my head looking at it. Otherwise good and a full range of greytones. 6', '2009-01-22 08:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
