(5211917, 758355, 101702, '<td valign="top">Too much bland sky for my liking. That much sky is fine when it''s dark, brooding and foreboding, lots of contrasts etc, but in this shot it''s just an expanse of grey taking up half the shot. A shame because the cloud, mountain and building look nice.</td>', 'Too much bland sky for my liking. That much sky is fine when it''s dark, brooding and foreboding, lots of contrasts etc, but in this shot it''s just an expanse of grey taking up half the shot. A shame because the cloud, mountain and building look nice.', '2009-01-22 14:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
