(5211986, 757599, 62249, '<td valign="top">This is cool. Composition is great. Blacks need to be a little darker (maybe burn the treeline on shore a bit to make them more distinct from the buildings). Might crop off a little of the foreground to omit the two black specks toward the lower right.</td>', 'This is cool. Composition is great. Blacks need to be a little darker (maybe burn the treeline on shore a bit to make them more distinct from the buildings). Might crop off a little of the foreground to omit the two black specks toward the lower right.', '2009-01-22 14:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211988, 758338, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the light fence in the foreground and the dark fencing in the middle. Trees also look good. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the light fence in the foreground and the dark fencing in the middle. Trees also look good. Nice shot.', '2009-01-22 14:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211992, 756096, 62249, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like the graphic shapes.</td>', 'Interesting. I like the graphic shapes.', '2009-01-22 15:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211997, 758196, 101702, '<td valign="top">I was almost thinking that this DNMC as I was baffled as to why this was in the style of Ansel Admas. Then I googled "Ansel Adams Still Life" and found what I initially thought was an identical image which would lead to a DQ for you. Then I finally twigged that this was very much a recreation of an Ansel Adams original, and to that end, I think you''ve done a great job. Completely different to every other submission in the challenge. <br/> <br/>A bit more of a contrasty image would work better I think though...</td>', 'I was almost thinking that this DNMC as I was baffled as to why this was in the style of Ansel Admas. Then I googled "Ansel Adams Still Life" and found what I initially thought was an identical image which would lead to a DQ for you. Then I finally twigged that this was very much a recreation of an Ansel Adams original, and to that end, I think you''ve done a great job. Completely different to every other submission in the challenge.  A bit more of a contrasty image would work better I think though...', '2009-01-22 15:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211998, 758139, 62249, '<td valign="top">Work on composition. This seems to be a shot of...nothing. That is, there''s no real subject here. One of Adams''s hallmarks was a dark sky, yet yours is white.</td>', 'Work on composition. This seems to be a shot of...nothing. That is, there''s no real subject here. One of Adams''s hallmarks was a dark sky, yet yours is white.', '2009-01-22 15:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211999, 758152, 101702, '<td valign="top">Lovely image but would work so much better if it was level</td>', 'Lovely image but would work so much better if it was level', '2009-01-22 15:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212004, 757931, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I think you''ll do well with this one. Beautiful composition, good tonal range, and definitely Adamsesque.</td>', 'Very nice. I think you''ll do well with this one. Beautiful composition, good tonal range, and definitely Adamsesque.', '2009-01-22 15:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212005, 758039, 101702, '<td valign="top">Looks like the Na Pali coastline on on the Hawaiian island of Kaua''i. Looks slightly off level to me though, and I''m a stickler for that :-)</td>', 'Looks like the Na Pali coastline on on the Hawaiian island of Kaua''i. Looks slightly off level to me though, and I''m a stickler for that :-)', '2009-01-22 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212007, 758231, 62249, '<td valign="top">Like the composition on this one. Maybe burn the upper right corner a bit to balance it with the dark lower left corner and also bring out details of sun/clouds.</td>', 'Like the composition on this one. Maybe burn the upper right corner a bit to balance it with the dark lower left corner and also bring out details of sun/clouds.', '2009-01-22 15:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212008, 757143, 101702, '<td valign="top">A smaller border would be better for this size image... I feel it is large enough to be distracting from such a lovely shot.</td>', 'A smaller border would be better for this size image... I feel it is large enough to be distracting from such a lovely shot.', '2009-01-22 15:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212012, 758138, 62249, '<td valign="top">A good candidate for the Single Tree challenge. Nicely composed. Good drama in the sky.</td>', 'A good candidate for the Single Tree challenge. Nicely composed. Good drama in the sky.', '2009-01-22 15:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212015, 758347, 88718, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite of the competition. Well done. Hope it''s a ribbon.</td>', 'This is my favourite of the competition. Well done. Hope it''s a ribbon.', '2009-01-22 15:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212034, 757145, 84438, '<td valign="top">OK, you asked for it. :)<br/> <br/>Though I find your composition fairly interesting, the photo appears to be too contrasty.  The highlights are so blown out, and the shadows are so dark, there seems to be very little detail left.<br/> <br/>I would have loved to have seen the texture of the woodgrain, or the reflections in the water..  But it''s all gone. :(</td>', 'OK, you asked for it. :) Though I find your composition fairly interesting, the photo appears to be too contrasty.  The highlights are so blown out, and the shadows are so dark, there seems to be very little detail left. I would have loved to have seen the texture of the woodgrain, or the reflections in the water..  But it''s all gone. :(', '2009-01-22 15:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212037, 756096, 84438, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is fantastic!  Love the minimalism of this shot.</td>', 'Wow.  This is fantastic!  Love the minimalism of this shot.', '2009-01-22 15:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212040, 758062, 84438, '<td valign="top">There appears to have been some heavy PP done on this photo.  Though the location is obviously great, and the composition is very pleasing, it just seems to lack in some of the lower areas...  As if really dark areas of the photo were pushed too far.</td>', 'There appears to have been some heavy PP done on this photo.  Though the location is obviously great, and the composition is very pleasing, it just seems to lack in some of the lower areas...  As if really dark areas of the photo were pushed too far.', '2009-01-22 15:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
