(5212056, 758267, 84438, '<td valign="top">Not too crazy about the black sky (Because it looks so post processed), but there is a lot to like about this photo.</td>', 'Not too crazy about the black sky (Because it looks so post processed), but there is a lot to like about this photo.', '2009-01-22 15:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
