(5216157, 757518, 51747, '<td valign="top">Very much Ansel like tones.</td>', 'Very much Ansel like tones.', '2009-01-24 10:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216165, 758277, 101117, '<td valign="top">The foreground tree for some reason stands out way too much, and the clouds have an odd over processed look about them. Perhaps too much contrast has caused this, not sure though.</td>', 'The foreground tree for some reason stands out way too much, and the clouds have an odd over processed look about them. Perhaps too much contrast has caused this, not sure though.', '2009-01-24 10:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216182, 758196, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not really sure how this is representative of Adams apart from the fact it''s B&amp;W, however since I''m not familiar with his entire work I''ll let that go. That aside, this really just feels like you''ve taken a snapshot in the kitchen and converted it to B&amp;W.<br/> <br/>The main subject isn''t particularly appealing, and the other objects tend to just clutter rather than add anything.</td>', 'Not really sure how this is representative of Adams apart from the fact it''s B&W, however since I''m not familiar with his entire work I''ll let that go. That aside, this really just feels like you''ve taken a snapshot in the kitchen and converted it to B&W. The main subject isn''t particularly appealing, and the other objects tend to just clutter rather than add anything.', '2009-01-24 10:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216186, 757977, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice scene, though something more out of an illustrated children''s novel than Ansel Adams I feel. I have no problem with the blown out area itself, but I feel it stops a little abruptly making it look just blown out rather than adding. Overall, a nice shot with an interesting mood. 6</td>', 'This is a very nice scene, though something more out of an illustrated children''s novel than Ansel Adams I feel. I have no problem with the blown out area itself, but I feel it stops a little abruptly making it look just blown out rather than adding. Overall, a nice shot with an interesting mood. 6', '2009-01-24 10:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216187, 757071, 101117, '<td valign="top">There is just too much in the frame here, and with the black and white conversion it makes it even more untidy. Technically it''s good, it''s always difficult to get snow right and you seem to have made a good job, just don''t like the subject(s) itself.</td>', 'There is just too much in the frame here, and with the black and white conversion it makes it even more untidy. Technically it''s good, it''s always difficult to get snow right and you seem to have made a good job, just don''t like the subject(s) itself.', '2009-01-24 10:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216191, 758071, 101117, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t really have anything that grabs you or holds your interest. I think it could be down to 2 things. The angle you have taken the shot isn''t great, I think from a little lower down would have helped, though perhaps you were avoiding that for the background. The second is the way you have converted it to B&amp;W, it looks like a straight forward de-saturation, which as well as removing colour has also removed any real life from the shot.<br/> <br/>Experiment with B&amp;W conversions, there is a million different ways of doing it. I personally like Nik Software Silver Efx Pro but I''m sure there''s loads of others out there you can try as well.</td>', 'This shot doesn''t really have anything that grabs you or holds your interest. I think it could be down to 2 things. The angle you have taken the shot isn''t great, I think from a little lower down would have helped, though perhaps you were avoiding that for the background. The second is the way you have converted it to B&W, it looks like a straight forward de-saturation, which as well as removing colour has also removed any real life from the shot. Experiment with B&W conversions, there is a million different ways of doing it. I personally like Nik Software Silver Efx Pro but I''m sure there''s loads of others out there you can try as well.', '2009-01-24 10:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216193, 757117, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, like the contrast between the black and white llamas(?).<br/> <br/>Background is a bit distracting, only slightly out of focus, which I always feel is worse than in focus because it''s there but not quite if you see what I mean.</td>', 'Nice shot, like the contrast between the black and white llamas(?). Background is a bit distracting, only slightly out of focus, which I always feel is worse than in focus because it''s there but not quite if you see what I mean.', '2009-01-24 10:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216194, 758139, 101117, '<td valign="top">There is no main subject here and the completely washed out sky doesn''t help at all either. Everything is in focus, but nothing in particular grabs your attention and the B&amp;W conversion just adds a harsh element to it.</td>', 'There is no main subject here and the completely washed out sky doesn''t help at all either. Everything is in focus, but nothing in particular grabs your attention and the B&W conversion just adds a harsh element to it.', '2009-01-24 10:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216202, 758306, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot with a good mood. I can''t actually tell if it''s snow / ice / water, I suspect it is frozen water with snow on top, either way, that doesn''t really matter too much. The blown out sun has ended up being a strange shape, but what can you do, shooting with the sun in the frame is always a touch unpredictable. My only other complaint is that there isn''t really any detail in the dark areas, but this is made up for in a way by the detail in the clouds. 6</td>', 'This is a nice shot with a good mood. I can''t actually tell if it''s snow / ice / water, I suspect it is frozen water with snow on top, either way, that doesn''t really matter too much. The blown out sun has ended up being a strange shape, but what can you do, shooting with the sun in the frame is always a touch unpredictable. My only other complaint is that there isn''t really any detail in the dark areas, but this is made up for in a way by the detail in the clouds. 6', '2009-01-24 10:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216204, 756947, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment... <br/>Beautiful image and processing. Gorgeous clouds, the snow/sand blend adds a great element of contrast. One of the best in the challenge, 10.</td>', 'Coming back to comment... Beautiful image and processing. Gorgeous clouds, the snow/sand blend adds a great element of contrast. One of the best in the challenge, 10.', '2009-01-24 10:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216207, 758131, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice Adams style shot, like the detail on the mountain. The one thing I think it is missing is any real depth, which you would no doubt have get if there was any clouds in the sky. Don''t you hate it when the weather won''t play along! 7</td>', 'This is a nice Adams style shot, like the detail on the mountain. The one thing I think it is missing is any real depth, which you would no doubt have get if there was any clouds in the sky. Don''t you hate it when the weather won''t play along! 7', '2009-01-24 10:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216208, 758142, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment...<br/>Gorgeous toning, lovely details. Love the little knot in the wood leading to the rose. 10</td>', 'Coming back to comment...Gorgeous toning, lovely details. Love the little knot in the wood leading to the rose. 10', '2009-01-24 10:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216209, 757773, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment...<br/>Gorgeous tones and contrast. Lovely shadows and dof. 10</td>', 'Coming back to comment...Gorgeous tones and contrast. Lovely shadows and dof. 10', '2009-01-24 10:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216210, 758272, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment...<br/>Stunning work here. Love the wispy clouds! 10</td>', 'Coming back to comment...Stunning work here. Love the wispy clouds! 10', '2009-01-24 10:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216211, 757044, 101117, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure what this is, but it makes for an interesting shot nonetheless. I love the depth in the sky, it gives this photo a very Adams feel.</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure what this is, but it makes for an interesting shot nonetheless. I love the depth in the sky, it gives this photo a very Adams feel.', '2009-01-24 10:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216215, 757346, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, think it would have helped if the main subject (the building) was a little more off centre. Also, you''re not using the full available tonal range here, a curves / contrast adjustment could have helped liven this up a lot.</td>', 'Nice shot, think it would have helped if the main subject (the building) was a little more off centre. Also, you''re not using the full available tonal range here, a curves / contrast adjustment could have helped liven this up a lot.', '2009-01-24 10:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216216, 757421, 89287, '<td valign="top">nice but not enough contrast</td>', 'nice but not enough contrast', '2009-01-24 10:57:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5216220, 756622, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with good detail on the mountain. The lower half of shot is a little dull in comparison though, you could really have helped it out with some selective dodging and burning, especially of the river itself.</td>', 'Nice shot with good detail on the mountain. The lower half of shot is a little dull in comparison though, you could really have helped it out with some selective dodging and burning, especially of the river itself.', '2009-01-24 10:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216222, 758220, 89287, '<td valign="top">nice shot a little blown out on the water</td>', 'nice shot a little blown out on the water', '2009-01-24 11:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216224, 758271, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great dramatic clouds and good tonal range. Not sure what your subject is though, the highest tree possibly? After looking at this for a while there are two things which I don''t like about it. The cloud to the left of the shot is more prominent than the rest and steals my attention, but it''s not quite interesting enough on its own to make the shot. The second thing is what I already mentioned, a lack of any real subject.</td>', 'Great dramatic clouds and good tonal range. Not sure what your subject is though, the highest tree possibly? After looking at this for a while there are two things which I don''t like about it. The cloud to the left of the shot is more prominent than the rest and steals my attention, but it''s not quite interesting enough on its own to make the shot. The second thing is what I already mentioned, a lack of any real subject.', '2009-01-24 11:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216225, 757455, 89287, '<td valign="top">very nice foggy coastal shot</td>', 'very nice foggy coastal shot', '2009-01-24 11:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216228, 757262, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I''m guessing that''s foam rather than ice on the ground. Good detail in the rock but I think it would have been nicer to see a bit more of the top of the cliff here.</td>', 'Nice shot, I''m guessing that''s foam rather than ice on the ground. Good detail in the rock but I think it would have been nicer to see a bit more of the top of the cliff here.', '2009-01-24 11:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216233, 758037, 101117, '<td valign="top">I know Adams did a shot a lot like this, but I never particularly liked it, same applies to this one I''m afraid. Technically I think it''s pretty good, a touch dark perhaps. Might have been nice to see a bit more of the plain ground at the bottom of the shot.</td>', 'I know Adams did a shot a lot like this, but I never particularly liked it, same applies to this one I''m afraid. Technically I think it''s pretty good, a touch dark perhaps. Might have been nice to see a bit more of the plain ground at the bottom of the shot.', '2009-01-24 11:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216237, 756468, 101117, '<td valign="top">Looks like there''s been some motion blur here and you''ve used a ton of sharpening to try and correct it, which unfortunately hasn''t done wonders for the general quality of the shot.</td>', 'Looks like there''s been some motion blur here and you''ve used a ton of sharpening to try and correct it, which unfortunately hasn''t done wonders for the general quality of the shot.', '2009-01-24 11:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216238, 757354, 101117, '<td valign="top">Think you could have done something with the sky here to make the shot more dramatic, would have really helped.</td>', 'Think you could have done something with the sky here to make the shot more dramatic, would have really helped.', '2009-01-24 11:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216240, 758142, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice texture on both the rose and the wood, but for some reason the rose looks plastic, probably something in the PP which has caused that.</td>', 'Nice texture on both the rose and the wood, but for some reason the rose looks plastic, probably something in the PP which has caused that.', '2009-01-24 11:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216242, 758143, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment... <br/> <br/>Lovely sense of drama. Wonderful tones! 9</td>', 'Coming back to comment...  Lovely sense of drama. Wonderful tones! 9', '2009-01-24 11:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216243, 757556, 101117, '<td valign="top">Even after reading the title I''m not entirely sure what this is, my best bet is ice cream!</td>', 'Even after reading the title I''m not entirely sure what this is, my best bet is ice cream!', '2009-01-24 11:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216245, 757470, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment... <br/> <br/>Beautifully stark. Wonderfully wild! 9</td>', 'Coming back to comment...  Beautifully stark. Wonderfully wild! 9', '2009-01-24 11:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216246, 757410, 101117, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the angle helps here. Sky is also a touch bland, don''t you hate it when the weather won''t play along!</td>', 'I don''t think the angle helps here. Sky is also a touch bland, don''t you hate it when the weather won''t play along!', '2009-01-24 11:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216247, 757773, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice tonal range and lighting here. This is one of the better shots I''ve seen in the challenge. 8</td>', 'Very nice tonal range and lighting here. This is one of the better shots I''ve seen in the challenge. 8', '2009-01-24 11:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216248, 757931, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment... <br/> <br/>And such gorgeous reflections they are! Wonderful tones! 9</td>', 'Coming back to comment...  And such gorgeous reflections they are! Wonderful tones! 9', '2009-01-24 11:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216249, 756849, 89287, '<td valign="top">very nice detail</td>', 'very nice detail', '2009-01-24 11:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216251, 757677, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment... <br/> <br/>This is incredibly stunning! It''s hard to tell where the sky ends and the mountains begin. 9</td>', 'Coming back to comment...  This is incredibly stunning! It''s hard to tell where the sky ends and the mountains begin. 9', '2009-01-24 11:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216252, 758347, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment... <br/> <br/>Brilliant use of light and shadow! 9</td>', 'Coming back to comment...  Brilliant use of light and shadow! 9', '2009-01-24 11:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216254, 757328, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good shot, really like the combination of light and shadowed areas on the rock. I think there is a little more tonal range available for use here to just give the image a touch more drama. 7</td>', 'Good shot, really like the combination of light and shadowed areas on the rock. I think there is a little more tonal range available for use here to just give the image a touch more drama. 7', '2009-01-24 11:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216255, 758263, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment... <br/> <br/>Gorgeous! Beautiful tonal range and stunning detail! 9</td>', 'Coming back to comment...  Gorgeous! Beautiful tonal range and stunning detail! 9', '2009-01-24 11:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216257, 758220, 101117, '<td valign="top">Too much of this image is blown out, also, I think the horizon is a little lop sided.</td>', 'Too much of this image is blown out, also, I think the horizon is a little lop sided.', '2009-01-24 11:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5216258, 758001, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment... <br/> <br/>Beautiful scenery! It looks so peaceful and lonely. Love the leaning tree. Stunning tones! 9</td>', 'Coming back to comment...  Beautiful scenery! It looks so peaceful and lonely. Love the leaning tree. Stunning tones! 9', '2009-01-24 11:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
