(5218465, 757476, 102505, '<td valign="top">Not enough black to balance out the white but a great subject.<br/>I would have framed a little differently to let in less of the sky and more scene to the side of the castle.....if there was anything to see. :P</td>', 'Not enough black to balance out the white but a great subject.I would have framed a little differently to let in less of the sky and more scene to the side of the castle.....if there was anything to see. :P', '2009-01-25 19:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218470, 757211, 102505, '<td valign="top">Looks unreal. I feel like I might be stepping through the bog on Yoda''s planet. Star Wars geeks can flame me now for not knowing the name. haha<br/>I would have tried to underexpose the sky just a tad to bring out the "mist" of the water against the dark rocks.</td>', 'Looks unreal. I feel like I might be stepping through the bog on Yoda''s planet. Star Wars geeks can flame me now for not knowing the name. hahaI would have tried to underexpose the sky just a tad to bring out the "mist" of the water against the dark rocks.', '2009-01-25 19:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218488, 757971, 102505, '<td valign="top">I would like to see it a little softer with less exposure. But a beautiufl shot of a great subject none the less! cheers!</td>', 'I would like to see it a little softer with less exposure. But a beautiufl shot of a great subject none the less! cheers!', '2009-01-25 19:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218490, 757771, 102505, '<td valign="top">Bummer about the grain. if not for, this would be one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Bummer about the grain. if not for, this would be one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2009-01-25 19:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218494, 758001, 102505, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! absolutely brilliant. Framing, tones, sharpness, exposure. All of it. Cheers to you on this (fingers crossed) ribbon winning shot! 8</td>', 'Brilliant! absolutely brilliant. Framing, tones, sharpness, exposure. All of it. Cheers to you on this (fingers crossed) ribbon winning shot! 8', '2009-01-25 19:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218504, 758131, 102505, '<td valign="top">I feel like the contrast might be a bit too high on this one. Though a beautiful picture none the less, I would love to see more of the midtones.</td>', 'I feel like the contrast might be a bit too high on this one. Though a beautiful picture none the less, I would love to see more of the midtones.', '2009-01-25 19:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218506, 757609, 102505, '<td valign="top">What a haunting picture. Though I''m not usually a fan of filters this one jumps out at me. I like!</td>', 'What a haunting picture. Though I''m not usually a fan of filters this one jumps out at me. I like!', '2009-01-25 19:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218513, 758291, 102505, '<td valign="top">Best tones I''m yet to see in this challenge. Great eye, well framed. Looks a bit over sharpened or maybe a high ISO. Bummer for that, but cheers either way!!</td>', 'Best tones I''m yet to see in this challenge. Great eye, well framed. Looks a bit over sharpened or maybe a high ISO. Bummer for that, but cheers either way!!', '2009-01-25 19:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218534, 756547, 98771, '<td valign="top">Really like the composition of this.</td>', 'Really like the composition of this.', '2009-01-25 19:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218541, 758182, 24486, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective. I hope the camera did not get wet.</td>', 'Love the perspective. I hope the camera did not get wet.', '2009-01-25 20:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218652, 758037, 80904, '<td valign="top">Magnificent Job! I am Impressed with your shot. You made a cluttered shot look beautiful. Great job 10</td>', 'Magnificent Job! I am Impressed with your shot. You made a cluttered shot look beautiful. Great job 10', '2009-01-25 21:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218656, 757556, 51379, '<td valign="top">LOL...Good one!</td>', 'LOL...Good one!', '2009-01-25 21:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218762, 757328, 77196, '<td valign="top">You need some white puffy clouds... This is a very nice shot that at least captures Adams'' style of highlight and shadow. Nicely done.</td>', 'You need some white puffy clouds... This is a very nice shot that at least captures Adams'' style of highlight and shadow. Nicely done.', '2009-01-25 21:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218811, 758182, 15511, '<td valign="top">Compositionally, I really like this image; some increased contrast in the cliffs and in the foam could enhance its Adams-like qualities. Good job.</td>', 'Compositionally, I really like this image; some increased contrast in the cliffs and in the foam could enhance its Adams-like qualities. Good job.', '2009-01-25 22:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218821, 757145, 15511, '<td valign="top">Your image has only four tones: black, dark gray, light gray, and white. Adams'' style usually took advantage of nine to eleven tonal ranges to emphasise the textures and depth of what he saw and wished to reproduce.</td>', 'Your image has only four tones: black, dark gray, light gray, and white. Adams'' style usually took advantage of nine to eleven tonal ranges to emphasise the textures and depth of what he saw and wished to reproduce.', '2009-01-25 22:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218822, 758152, 77196, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t hurt you that Crater Lake is one of my favorite places. If you''ve never driven the rim at sunset, it is well worth doing - though probably not a winter time activity. The photo is a bit dark, a bit more of stark white vs. darker areas would be closer to Adams'' style.</td>', 'It doesn''t hurt you that Crater Lake is one of my favorite places. If you''ve never driven the rim at sunset, it is well worth doing - though probably not a winter time activity. The photo is a bit dark, a bit more of stark white vs. darker areas would be closer to Adams'' style.', '2009-01-25 22:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218921, 757599, 15511, '<td valign="top">Some additional contrast in the sky and buildings could emphasise the details in them. I like the composition.</td>', 'Some additional contrast in the sky and buildings could emphasise the details in them. I like the composition.', '2009-01-25 23:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218953, 756096, 15511, '<td valign="top">Some more contrast could emphasise the details. Nice clean image.</td>', 'Some more contrast could emphasise the details. Nice clean image.', '2009-01-25 23:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218957, 757346, 15511, '<td valign="top">More contrast and some more sharpening could give your image more pop.</td>', 'More contrast and some more sharpening could give your image more pop.', '2009-01-25 23:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218963, 757145, 25270, '<td valign="top">much to stark; lacks the feeling of depth</td>', 'much to stark; lacks the feeling of depth', '2009-01-25 23:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218965, 758196, 15511, '<td valign="top">Nice, crisp image.<br/>I don''t believe that specular highlights should be considered part of the full tonal range. Eggs in direct light are usually white.</td>', 'Nice, crisp image.I don''t believe that specular highlights should be considered part of the full tonal range. Eggs in direct light are usually white.', '2009-01-25 23:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5218966, 757476, 15511, '<td valign="top">More contrast in the shadows could increase interest in their details.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-28 12:58:30.</i></td>', 'More contrast in the shadows could increase interest in their details.', '2009-01-25 23:24:50.000000', '2009-01-28 12:58:30.000000', 1),
