(5221648, 756458, 70270, '<td valign="top">nice tonal range, good sharpness throughout, well composed and an interesting sky.  You get my 10 for this challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'nice tonal range, good sharpness throughout, well composed and an interesting sky.  You get my 10 for this challenge.  Good luck!', '2009-01-27 08:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
