(5221650, 757759, 70270, '<td valign="top">You''ve got black, you''ve got white, you''ve got 18% grey ... Ansel likes!  So do I.  9</td>', 'You''ve got black, you''ve got white, you''ve got 18% grey ... Ansel likes!  So do I.  9', '2009-01-27 08:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
