(5223002, 757676, 74979, '<td valign="top">the most stunning of the challenge, IMO<br/> <br/>What a wonderful piece of art you have rendered here, and in the presence of such natural beauty!<br/> <br/>You are so LUCKY to have been in such an amazing place..I am <i>very</i> jealous!<br/> <br/>congrats!<br/> <br/>ETA: PLEASE also post the original!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-28 00:08:52.</i></td>', 'the most stunning of the challenge, IMO What a wonderful piece of art you have rendered here, and in the presence of such natural beauty! You are so LUCKY to have been in such an amazing place..I am very jealous! congrats! ETA: PLEASE also post the original!', '2009-01-28 00:08:10.000000', '2009-01-28 00:08:52.000000', 0),
