(5223037, 757211, 54446, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your blue ribbon.  A very compelling image with superb management of detail in the shadows.  Well done!</td>', 'Congratulations on your blue ribbon.  A very compelling image with superb management of detail in the shadows.  Well done!', '2009-01-28 00:13:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5223041, 758138, 74979, '<td valign="top">that midframe shadow, placed so well..it makes the shot...the lines pull you right into the place.  It also balances the vast nature of that sky!<br/> <br/>sweet shot, congrats!</td>', 'that midframe shadow, placed so well..it makes the shot...the lines pull you right into the place.  It also balances the vast nature of that sky! sweet shot, congrats!', '2009-01-28 00:14:38.000000', NULL, 0),
