(5223047, 756849, 54645, '<td valign="top">Well done, I scored this well. You sound a bit bitter about the low votes, don''t sweat the small stuff...you have a great photograph for the wall!</td>', 'Well done, I scored this well. You sound a bit bitter about the low votes, don''t sweat the small stuff...you have a great photograph for the wall!', '2009-01-28 00:15:27.000000', NULL, 0),
