(5223588, 757212, 16230, '<td valign="top">Excellent range of tones in this one Mae! I think it''s obvious that the voters only wanted to see wide-angle views of dramatic sweeping vistas... preferably in Yosemite. ;D<br/></td>', 'Excellent range of tones in this one Mae! I think it''s obvious that the voters only wanted to see wide-angle views of dramatic sweeping vistas... preferably in Yosemite. ;D', '2009-01-28 04:37:42.000000', NULL, 0),
