(5224346, 757968, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, great tones, HORRIBLE oversharpening.  Really, are we going to have to put you in a 12-step program for that or what?  (My laptop does show sharpening just a wee bit more than some monitors, but this really does make my eyes bleed.)</td>', 'Wonderful composition, great tones, HORRIBLE oversharpening.  Really, are we going to have to put you in a 12-step program for that or what?  (My laptop does show sharpening just a wee bit more than some monitors, but this really does make my eyes bleed.)', '2009-01-28 12:49:07.000000', NULL, 0),
