(5224518, 757737, 64568, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot. Nice textures and the shadows are wonderful, nice one.</td>', 'I think this is a great shot. Nice textures and the shadows are wonderful, nice one.', '2009-01-28 14:45:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5224576, 757346, 102305, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone that commented, I was able to pick out some useful statements from all of them. The challenge was an experience, as it was the first time that I''d set out on a project. I''ve got into a habit lately of trying to get it right in camera, which has steered me away from cropping, plus I probably wasn''t as familiar with what I was allowed to do as I could have been. Sharpening is also something I''ve tended to avoid, especially when I''ve pushed the contrast to the limit as I have here. It wouild have been nice to have teh odd cloud to play with, but the weather wasn''t as accomodating as I''d have liked, but at least it wasn''t solid, dull grey cloud like it had been an hour earlier.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-28 17:11:49.</i></td>', 'Thanks to everyone that commented, I was able to pick out some useful statements from all of them. The challenge was an experience, as it was the first time that I''d set out on a project. I''ve got into a habit lately of trying to get it right in camera, which has steered me away from cropping, plus I probably wasn''t as familiar with what I was allowed to do as I could have been. Sharpening is also something I''ve tended to avoid, especially when I''ve pushed the contrast to the limit as I have here. It wouild have been nice to have teh odd cloud to play with, but the weather wasn''t as accomodating as I''d have liked, but at least it wasn''t solid, dull grey cloud like it had been an hour earlier.', '2009-01-28 15:11:32.000000', '2009-01-28 17:11:49.000000', 0),
(5224595, 757211, 39427, '<td valign="top">Another blue for Joe, excellent... I had a hunch this was you!</td>', 'Another blue for Joe, excellent... I had a hunch this was you!', '2009-01-28 15:17:52.000000', NULL, 0),
