(5225077, 758232, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>nicely done, and the snow/ice are well-handled here</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!nicely done, and the snow/ice are well-handled here', '2009-01-28 19:50:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5225085, 758355, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>I like the use of negative space here.  The "extra" sky puts a sense of context here, and the mission is not a dominant, grand piece of architecture. Instead, it conveys a sense of reverent hope &amp; faith, though surrounded by vast emptiness.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!I like the use of negative space here.  The "extra" sky puts a sense of context here, and the mission is not a dominant, grand piece of architecture. Instead, it conveys a sense of reverent hope & faith, though surrounded by vast emptiness.', '2009-01-28 19:54:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5225088, 758099, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>stark, textured, dramatic composition</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!stark, textured, dramatic composition', '2009-01-28 19:56:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5225091, 756850, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>A very well done tribute to Frozen Lake and Cliffs, both in composition/subject, but also in tone and execution.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!A very well done tribute to Frozen Lake and Cliffs, both in composition/subject, but also in tone and execution.', '2009-01-28 19:57:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5225094, 758215, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>not so much Ansel here, I think, but a luminous and wonderful image all the same</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!not so much Ansel here, I think, but a luminous and wonderful image all the same', '2009-01-28 19:58:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5225099, 757737, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>this could be in Ansel''s textbook series, such a great example of zone &amp; control<br/> <br/>it also evokes the feeling of his Silverton, Colorado image very nicely</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!this could be in Ansel''s textbook series, such a great example of zone & control it also evokes the feeling of his Silverton, Colorado image very nicely', '2009-01-28 20:00:19.000000', NULL, 0),
