(5226020, 758196, 22301, '<td valign="top">I saw this entry and hoped it would do well. I am sorry it was not a successful score but the image is very good. The tones came out really well in black and white.<br/>One time I misspelled a Title and sent a Ticket to the Site Council and they fixed it for me. Just in case there is a next time.</td>', 'I saw this entry and hoped it would do well. I am sorry it was not a successful score but the image is very good. The tones came out really well in black and white.One time I misspelled a Title and sent a Ticket to the Site Council and they fixed it for me. Just in case there is a next time.', '2009-01-29 12:25:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5226036, 756849, 61559, '<td valign="top">Great shot! The wisp of snow is a great subsitute for Ansel''s everpresent clouds. I absolutely love the Bear Lake area and this is so much better than anything I''ve ever been able to get there.<br/> <br/>It would be nice if we could get the sun to come up in the west for awhile so we could shoot the Front Range in afternoon clouds and evening light wouldn''t it? ;)</td>', 'Great shot! The wisp of snow is a great subsitute for Ansel''s everpresent clouds. I absolutely love the Bear Lake area and this is so much better than anything I''ve ever been able to get there. It would be nice if we could get the sun to come up in the west for awhile so we could shoot the Front Range in afternoon clouds and evening light wouldn''t it? ;)', '2009-01-29 12:47:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5226208, 758287, 48697, '<td valign="top">One of my tops pics for the challenge, I was one of your 8''s. Way underrated imo.</td>', 'One of my tops pics for the challenge, I was one of your 8''s. Way underrated imo.', '2009-01-29 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
