(5226274, 756849, 54446, '<td valign="top">from	DPChallenge &lt;admin@dpchallenge.com&gt;<br/>to	hahn23@gmail.com<br/>date	Thu, Jan 29, 2009 at 1:21 PM<br/>subject	DPChallenge Validation<br/> <br/>Reply<br/> <br/><i>We are happy to inform you that your submission to the Ansel Adams II challenge ("After the Winter Storm") has been validated.<br/>Your entry has been reviewed by the Site Council and/or Administrators, who have confirmed your submission.<br/>Thank you for your continued participation in DPChallenge!</i> <br/>********<br/> <br/>Thanks, SC and/or Admins!  Much appreciated.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-29 16:07:23.</i></td>', 'from	DPChallenge <admin@dpchallenge.com>to	hahn23@gmail.comdate	Thu, Jan 29, 2009 at 1:21 PMsubject	DPChallenge Validation Reply We are happy to inform you that your submission to the Ansel Adams II challenge ("After the Winter Storm") has been validated.Your entry has been reviewed by the Site Council and/or Administrators, who have confirmed your submission.Thank you for your continued participation in DPChallenge! ******** Thanks, SC and/or Admins!  Much appreciated.', '2009-01-29 16:06:24.000000', '2009-01-29 16:07:23.000000', 0),
(5226405, 758037, 47470, '<td valign="top">There was an Ansel Adams shot like this that hung in my high school English classroom, and it is probably my favorite AA picture.  I''m so glad there was a shot like this in the challenge since I wasn''t able to do one myself, so thanks!</td>', 'There was an Ansel Adams shot like this that hung in my high school English classroom, and it is probably my favorite AA picture.  I''m so glad there was a shot like this in the challenge since I wasn''t able to do one myself, so thanks!', '2009-01-29 17:48:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5226532, 757537, 51379, '<td valign="top">With so many voters mentioning that this photo was leaning to the right, I just had to set a grid frame on it... it is perfectly in allignment... Just an optical illusion for you. Perhaps with slightly less foreground, this could have been avoided.</td>', 'With so many voters mentioning that this photo was leaning to the right, I just had to set a grid frame on it... it is perfectly in allignment... Just an optical illusion for you. Perhaps with slightly less foreground, this could have been avoided.', '2009-01-29 19:36:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5226922, 756947, 32767, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I''m always in awe of things that go up against the sea, in repose. At rest from one powerful force it battles another with calm reserve, awaiting its true game in seasons to come.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is beautiful. I''m always in awe of things that go up against the sea, in repose. At rest from one powerful force it battles another with calm reserve, awaiting its true game in seasons to come. ', '2009-01-30 00:06:24.000000', NULL, 0),
