(5227094, 757773, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well done landscape - you did a great job making good use of foreground interest and getting an excellent sense of depth to the scene.  Tones are good as well.  And very good choice to shoot this with the kit versus the long lens - landscapes need to be wide and expansive.  The longer lens tends to compact the scene too much in my opinion.  Congrats on an excellent score, very good placement, and a new PB!</td>', 'Very well done landscape - you did a great job making good use of foreground interest and getting an excellent sense of depth to the scene.  Tones are good as well.  And very good choice to shoot this with the kit versus the long lens - landscapes need to be wide and expansive.  The longer lens tends to compact the scene too much in my opinion.  Congrats on an excellent score, very good placement, and a new PB!', '2009-01-30 08:21:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5227329, 757441, 70000, '<td valign="top">WOW! Really great style and i love the setting</td>', 'WOW! Really great style and i love the setting', '2009-01-30 12:14:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5227340, 757676, 4767, '<td valign="top">VERY nice, Becky!  Really makes it worth getting up so early!  Wonderful to see the detail in the arch and that amazing light reflecting all around.  As usual, You ROCK!</td>', 'VERY nice, Becky!  Really makes it worth getting up so early!  Wonderful to see the detail in the arch and that amazing light reflecting all around.  As usual, You ROCK!', '2009-01-30 12:30:55.000000', NULL, 0),
