(5230032, 757144, 102776, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MelonMusketeer:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice place!  I feel that the pan crop may have hurt this one in the voting. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for commenting - I was wondering that as well.  I felt that to crop gave it more impact.  My post processing skills are still very limited so hopefully I can learh quick enough to at least get the scale of my photos right!</td>', 'Originally posted by MelonMusketeer: Nice place!  I feel that the pan crop may have hurt this one in the voting.   Thanks for commenting - I was wondering that as well.  I felt that to crop gave it more impact.  My post processing skills are still very limited so hopefully I can learh quick enough to at least get the scale of my photos right!', '2009-01-31 23:35:58.000000', NULL, 0),
