(5281834, 756458, 42495, '<td valign="top">This deservedly scored well in the AA challenge.  Well done B&amp;W photo.</td>', 'This deservedly scored well in the AA challenge.  Well done B&W photo.', '2009-03-01 19:52:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5285747, 758159, 13390, '<td valign="top">I like how this goes against the grain with definite highs and lows with the Black and White approach, I like it. I think what may have hurt is the fence and lack of definitive subject.</td>', 'I like how this goes against the grain with definite highs and lows with the Black and White approach, I like it. I think what may have hurt is the fence and lack of definitive subject.', '2009-03-03 14:18:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5285751, 758355, 13390, '<td valign="top">I like the tonal range of this shot and find the choice of extra sky intriguing. Maybe the positioning feels a tad off to me, maybe to due it being slightly off-center. Good job!</td>', 'I like the tonal range of this shot and find the choice of extra sky intriguing. Maybe the positioning feels a tad off to me, maybe to due it being slightly off-center. Good job!', '2009-03-03 14:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5285758, 756947, 13390, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely wonderful. I like the mixture of the snow and sunny sky, it gives the picture great depth. The tonal range captured is excellent with great preservation of details. The shadows are excellent leading lines and the subject of the boat is wonderful.</td>', 'This is absolutely wonderful. I like the mixture of the snow and sunny sky, it gives the picture great depth. The tonal range captured is excellent with great preservation of details. The shadows are excellent leading lines and the subject of the boat is wonderful.', '2009-03-03 14:23:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5285760, 758344, 13390, '<td valign="top">I particularly love the snow in the foreground here. I feel like I can reach out and touch it and has great form. I think the lack of a definitive subject makes it hard as the eye tends to wander trying to find it. Other than that, well done!</td>', 'I particularly love the snow in the foreground here. I feel like I can reach out and touch it and has great form. I think the lack of a definitive subject makes it hard as the eye tends to wander trying to find it. Other than that, well done!', '2009-03-03 14:25:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5285765, 757930, 13390, '<td valign="top">I really like the dark sky here contrasting with the bright clouds, it has a nice dramatic effect. The rest of the picture seems to blend together tonally (closely related tones seems to distract eye from the beauty of the scene). Well captured!</td>', 'I really like the dark sky here contrasting with the bright clouds, it has a nice dramatic effect. The rest of the picture seems to blend together tonally (closely related tones seems to distract eye from the beauty of the scene). Well captured!', '2009-03-03 14:28:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5285770, 756344, 13390, '<td valign="top">I particularly enjoy this shot. The leading lines are fantastic and I love the feel of the depth and space.</td>', 'I particularly enjoy this shot. The leading lines are fantastic and I love the feel of the depth and space.', '2009-03-03 14:28:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5285774, 757378, 13390, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why this didn''t do better. Excellent details and shadows and great overall tonal range. Excellent tribute to AA.</td>', 'I don''t know why this didn''t do better. Excellent details and shadows and great overall tonal range. Excellent tribute to AA.', '2009-03-03 14:29:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5285778, 758290, 13390, '<td valign="top">I really like the starkness of the tones in this shot. There are a lot of really intriguing lines and curves that are fun to look at.</td>', 'I really like the starkness of the tones in this shot. There are a lot of really intriguing lines and curves that are fun to look at.', '2009-03-03 14:30:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5285780, 758319, 13390, '<td valign="top">Now this shot is just plain cool. I can''t describe exactly what it it, but the texture just feels so right for the snow and lighting. It has a nice dreamy feel to it. It''s very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Now this shot is just plain cool. I can''t describe exactly what it it, but the texture just feels so right for the snow and lighting. It has a nice dreamy feel to it. It''s very pleasing to the eye.', '2009-03-03 14:32:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5285781, 758271, 13390, '<td valign="top">I like the dark, ominous sky here, it really sets the mood. I think if there were a little more burning to the sky that it could have nailed the dramatic effect. Well done and good capture!</td>', 'I like the dark, ominous sky here, it really sets the mood. I think if there were a little more burning to the sky that it could have nailed the dramatic effect. Well done and good capture!', '2009-03-03 14:33:57.000000', NULL, 0),
