(6773277, 756878, 138630, '<td valign="top">Looking through the top 25% or so of the previous Ansel Adams challenge and I must say I think this is splendid.  I started at 60th place and am working backwards so it''s early to tell for sure, but I know I would have given this at least a 7, probably an 8.  Love the light, the lines, the tonal range.</td>', 'Looking through the top 25% or so of the previous Ansel Adams challenge and I must say I think this is splendid.  I started at 60th place and am working backwards so it''s early to tell for sure, but I know I would have given this at least a 7, probably an 8.  Love the light, the lines, the tonal range.', '2012-05-19 19:22:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6773280, 757759, 138630, '<td valign="top">Looking through the previous Ansel Adams challenge - backwards from 60th place.  I really like this one - would have been among the 7''s or 8''s, I think, maybe higher.</td>', 'Looking through the previous Ansel Adams challenge - backwards from 60th place.  I really like this one - would have been among the 7''s or 8''s, I think, maybe higher.', '2012-05-19 19:29:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6773282, 757443, 138630, '<td valign="top">Working my way from 60th up to first in the previous Ansel Adams challenge, stopping to comment on a very few.  I do like this one and I also like hahn23''s comment.  This is in my opinion definitely in the style of even if the subject is not AA.  Wonderful sky.</td>', 'Working my way from 60th up to first in the previous Ansel Adams challenge, stopping to comment on a very few.  I do like this one and I also like hahn23''s comment.  This is in my opinion definitely in the style of even if the subject is not AA.  Wonderful sky.', '2012-05-19 19:36:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7089445, 757447, 74559, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful view! Wild indeed.</td>', 'What a beautiful view! Wild indeed.', '2013-08-19 02:59:25.000000', NULL, 0);
